WEBVTT

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:02.860
A   shipment   is  

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:04.420
waiting.   A   customer  

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.221
needs   an   answer.  

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:06.860
And   a   guess  

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:07.620
is   not   good  

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.700
enough.   Meet   HarborVoice.  

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.560
Nora   checks   fictional  

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.220
shipment   data,   explains  

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.160
what   is   known,  

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.040
and   keeps   human  

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.241
decisions   with   people.  

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.480
Across   languages.   With  

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.280
explicit   tools,   tested  

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.280
boundaries,   and   a  

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.120
clear   path   to  

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.820
review.   Explore   the  

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.220
voice   agent.   Hear  

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.660
the   evidence.   Build  

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.480
trust   into   the  

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.260
conversation.
